# Awesome Claude Status Bar — layout config
#
# One segment per line, in display order. Comment out or delete to disable.
# Use "---" to start a new row. Blank lines and # comments are ignored.
#
# Available segments:
#   dir          Current directory (~/...)
#   git          Branch name + dirty/clean/ahead/behind indicators
#   model        Active Claude model
#   context      Context window usage %
#   rate_limits  5-hour and 7-day rate limit usage
#   disk         Disk space used / total
#   mem          Memory pressure (ok/warn/critical)
#   batt         Battery charge + charging indicator
#   docker       Docker daemon status + container count

dir
git
model
context
rate_limits
---
disk
mem
batt
docker
